{"id":"623380","name":"金瓜山药红枣馒头","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/623380/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"金瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"山药","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"发酵粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"蒸熟的铁棍山药适量。","img":"images/623380/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"辗成泥。","img":"images/623380/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"金瓜用小勺挖入盆中。","img":"images/623380/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"跟山药混合均匀。","img":"images/623380/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入适量面粉。","img":"images/623380/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"少许温水，把发酵粉化开。","img":"images/623380/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒面粉上。","img":"images/623380/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅成絮状。","img":"images/623380/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"和成偏软一点的面团。有一些山药没揉碎也没关系。（面团软，容易把枣碎揉进去。）","img":"images/623380/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"适量去核红枣洗一下，控一下水。","img":"images/623380/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"切成红枣碎。","img":"images/623380/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"南瓜面团发好了。","img":"images/623380/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"把红枣碎放南瓜山药面团上。","img":"images/623380/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"把枣均揉进去。","img":"images/623380/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"揪成大小均匀的剂子。","img":"images/623380/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"取一剂子，揉成馒头形状。","img":"images/623380/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"饧20分钟。","img":"images/623380/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"冷水上屉，中小火蒸20分钟。","img":"images/623380/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"时间到关火，焖3分钟。","img":"images/623380/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/623380/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/623380/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}